From 309a23148f84170d7a9dd6911cbbd17baeaa9515 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diego <me@diegonmarcos.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 21:47:14 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] comms: on-device translation via external ML Kit engine
 (cloud-mail-libs)

On-device translation as a toggle alternative to DeepL, delegated over
AIDL IPC to the standalone cloud-mail-libs engine app so the mail APK stays
lean and language models are shared/downloaded once. Read path (received
messages); requires cloud-mail-libs installed, else DeepL remains.

- TranslateClient binds ITranslateEngine (signature permission), blocking.
- DeepL.canTranslate/getTargetLanguages/translate branch on pref deepl_ondevice.
- Manifest: uses-permission BIND_ENGINE + <queries> for the engine package.
